WEBVTT

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.700
Fairy-possessed.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.830
You're necessary in order to end it all.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.330
Just do as you're told.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.250
Fine, have it your way.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.790
Fairy-possession...

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.580
You don't truly want a conflict, either!

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:08.660
Is it because you don't see anything beyond it?

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:11.580
What ideas has Marco Bellwood put in your head?!

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:13.580
As if <i>you</i> know anything...

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.950
What's this power?

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.790
If I erase your fairy organ from within you,

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:29.200
I'm sure you... and your
fairy can still be saved.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:35.160
Save me? Save my fairy? You?

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.870
Who do you think you are?!

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.700
Bitch!

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:56.330
Marlya!

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:57.540
Free!

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:02.200
Are you okay?!

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.790
It was Wolfran!

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:08.120
Why is he after you?!

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:11.370
Looks like he was aware that I'm fairy-possessed.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:12.910
What?!

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:22.290
I won't run away from my fate anymore!

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:29.450
"Episode 21"
"Rusted Warrior and Unopening Door"

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.330
"Prime Minister's Official Residence"

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.040
What's going on?!

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.450
Director!

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.080
What's all this?

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.290
The prime minister was assassinated.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.540
Was it... the order?!

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:05.620
We can't be sure yet, but circumstances
suggest a fairy probably did it.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.330
We have news to report, too.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.660
"Dorothea HQ"

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.870
The order had already obtained
a fusion from the Suna forest.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.870
"Director's Office"

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:20.700
The order had already obtained
a fusion from the Suna forest.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:26.040
I didn't think any fusions currently existed.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:31.540
Also, the order knows that I'm fairy-possessed.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:32.750
But I thought...

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.700
Weren't we keeping that under wraps?

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:35.750
So, how?

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.290
Speaking of which, something's bothering me.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.040
What?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:43.870
Michel Connor, the guy Marlya arrested?

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.080
He's dead.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:52.660
He committed suicide in his jail cell,
but something about it bugs me.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:58.870
Perhaps he learned Marlya was
fairy-possessed while confronting her.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.250
Then, he somehow notified the order.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.000
As in, they have a spy inside the prison?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:11.160
Whatever it is, now that the order knows,
Marlya is off the case henceforth.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:13.620
Ensuring her safety is a top priority.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.290
Um...

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:23.250
I wonder if it might be better
to let the order come after me.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:27.040
As bait, to lure them out?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:31.370
You do realize it'll mean intentionally
exposing yourself to danger.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.000
He's right, you know!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.620
Don't do it, Marlya!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:39.120
Honestly, I'm a little scared.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.330
But I'm not alone.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:45.000
I have comrades. I have all of you!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:53.290
Please, director. Don't take
me off the investigation.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.620
I second that request.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.000
We will protect Marlya!

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:19.000
All right. Don't forget what you just said.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.500
Thank you, director!

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:28.790
They're discussing how to deal with
things at an emergency cabinet meeting.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:34.500
But with the prime minister dead, I can't
predict yet how the situation will shift.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:38.700
Nor do I know what action the
Duke of Kal-o, Ray Dawn, will take.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.200
Golbarn Helwise.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.790
I never thought I'd outlive you.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.410
"Unified Government Office"

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:17.080
What brings you here at a
time like this, Duke Kal-o?

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.950
I wish to see His Imperial Majesty.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:25.620
Now that our founding hero,
Prime Minister Golbarn, is dead,

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:28.120
each of Unified Zesskia's agencies,
and I myself,

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:35.830
must do what we can as one united
body to weather these trying times.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.040
I do not disagree, but...

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.660
I relinquish the title of
Duke of Kal-o, and its dominion.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:49.750
As a member of Unified Zesskia's government,
I want to work toward saving the situation.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.790
He won't be Duke of Kal-o anymore?

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:55.160
That's... what he said.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:58.290
Arrange an audience with His Majesty, at once.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.370
Yes, sir.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.700
You're...

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.080
I...

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.950
I am... a survivor of Suna.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.750
Now I see.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.910
Marlya.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.330
I'm all right.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.830
Ray Dawn has come to Rondacia.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:02.330
Ver is probably nearby, too.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.040
At last...

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:23.200
We respectfully supplicate the Original Fairy,
the progenitor of all things.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:26.950
For the ideal world to emerge...

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.000
I apologize, Archbishop.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:35.330
I failed to secure Marlya Noel.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:37.410
Did you...

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:43.660
But thanks to Griff here disposing
of Prime Minister Golbarn,

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.910
Ray Dawn has come wandering right along.

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:51.330
Probably Veronica Thorn as well,
as she wants him dead.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:56.330
The three fairy-possessed who could
be our elements are all in Rondacia.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:59.200
Yes. The plan nears its end.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.450
Ray Dawn is no pushover.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.750
Perhaps he's too difficult a target for you.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:09.330
But we have lured him to Rondacia.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:13.700
Yes, we will carry out this plan.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.580
Alone, we can accomplish nothing.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:20.290
We must all work together.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:25.120
Alas, mankind is foolish.
If you look back at history,

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:30.580
it's littered with instances of people
stealing from and killing one another.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:35.410
I saw it firsthand during
the War of Unification.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:38.790
A horrifying spectacle of slaughter.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:42.000
So much plundering, so many atrocities.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:50.500
But it isn't war that makes people go astray.
It's people who start conflicts!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:53.370
People bring about war!

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:58.830
People are people, and thus they err,
repeating the cycle endlessly.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.370
We must show them the proper way.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:07.500
Yes. Even if it means bringing about great pain.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:13.200
If people need that pain in order to repent,
we will see that they get it!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:19.250
<i>That</i> is our task, and the will of the fairies.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.450
It's just...

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:25.290
I cannot deny that we are short on manpower.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:28.870
I have someone in mind.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.250
Oh?

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:08.200
Divine Beast... Fairy possession...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.790
Now I know the full story.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.540
Dorothea will guard you.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.200
In that I trust.

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.660
You should keep an eye on her, too.

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.410
I realize that.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:34.950
I can't believe we're guarding him again.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:40.660
If we're looking for Veronica, sticking close
to Ray Dawn might prove helpful.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.500
That's true.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:46.370
They're both our duties.
There's nothing stopping me from helping.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:51.000
It's more important now to keep the order from
achieving their goal than it is to locate them.

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.870
Chima?

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:58.750
It must have hopped into one
of the cars from headquarters.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:08.410
You would resign as Duke of Kal-o,
and take Golbarn's place?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.080
I will obey Your Majesty's will.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.620
A service must be held for Golbarn.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:20.290
We should make preparations for a state funeral.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:22.660
This leaves me forlorn.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:27.870
Ray Dawn, I hereby appoint
you as acting prime minister.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:31.870
Assist me, and Unified Zesskia.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:33.370
As you wish.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.830
What, you're on the job too?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:55.870
I'm pretty sure that, unlike we humans,
it can see fairies with the naked eye.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:59.790
Or, maybe it can discern them by their scent?

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.370
Their scent...

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:02.120
Say what?

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.290
Oh, nothing.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:08.040
Maybe I can find Ver, if I get Chima to help me.

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:18.040
Ver, maybe you're not around here right now.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.660
Free! Marlya!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:22.950
Come with me!

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.830
A riot, at the prison?!

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.200
Yeah, we just got word.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.830
Could the order be behind it?

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.290
If so, I don't see the point.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.700
Military Minister Bohme.

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:37.870
Director Auler!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.750
What about the riot?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.330
His Excellency the acting prime
minister issued an order

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:46.750
to immediately mobilize the
military and suppress it.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:50.330
Have Dorothea continue to guard His Excellency.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.540
Yes, sir.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:55.120
This was a quick response.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.950
The acting prime minister is
experienced and resourceful,

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:01.120
both as a soldier, and as a ruler.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.410
It's just...

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:06.750
What's he thinking, deep down?

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.120
Come on, out!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.790
Seriously?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.870
--Run for it!
--Hurry! Let's go!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.040
Axel Laboo.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.080
Y-You...

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.160
Time for work.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:27.580
Well, let go of me first.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.830
I want you to give him a message.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:34.000
Huh? M-Message? Who do you mean, "him"?

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.910
Unfortunately, I haven't had any contact
with him since the palace assault.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.160
But you must know where he is.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.660
Hey, like I said...

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.750
Will you do it, or not?

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:49.660
Well, I totally get the vibe
that you'll kill me if I don't.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.910
Who in Dorothea is currently
assigned to guard me?

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:01.620
I believe it's currently
Free Underbar and Marlya Noel.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.290
Summon her. I just need Marlya Noel.

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:07.290
Yes, sir.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:10.500
Uh, Your Excellency...?

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.910
Did you... need me for something?

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:19.080
You're fairy-possessed as well, it seems.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.330
Yes, sir.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.750
What's the big idea?!

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:38.910
Can you hear them too? The voices of fairies?

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:49.950
What is my fairy saying?

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.500
It doesn't intend to take my life.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:56.120
It's simply trying to test me?!

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:58.700
As for your fairy...

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:02.660
This is more sadness, than hatred.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.830
No, it's salvation.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:16.660
A word of warning.
Pay no heed to the voices of fairies.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.500
It's ultimately nonsense.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.790
That's not true!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:24.450
This is a world we humans
built for our own sakes.

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:29.700
The balance the fairies are trying
to maintain no longer exists.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:33.370
Fairies are nothing more than human tools.

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.370
No! That's wrong!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:40.200
Why do you think so? Is that
what the fairies whisper to you?

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:42.160
You're mistaken!

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:47.410
To me, the voices of people are far
more important than those of fairies.

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:52.250
After what you did, you'd dare...

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:54.250
You'd dare to say that?!

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:01.120
I once committed a crime.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.500
I don't intend to evade that.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:09.620
Why did you burn down Suna?
It's where you grew up.

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.750
Fairy possession...

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:19.250
I had it in my head that only
I should have such a power.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.830
And that's why?

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:26.950
This Veronica Thorn who wants me dead.
She's fairy-possessed too?

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:31.370
That's right. She's using that power
to get revenge against you.

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:36.620
We must find her quickly,
to keep the order from using her.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:39.160
I'll find her whether I'm told to or not.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.500
I swear it!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.250
Could she be up there?

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:00.830
Let's take a look.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.160
She's not here.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:20.790
But I'm sure Ver is nearby.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.620
There's no way she's not.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.040
Agreed.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.700
Marlya.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.120
Could it be...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:36.040
Maybe Veronica <i>was</i> here.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:40.410
This isn't pointless.
We really are closing in on her.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.000
It's so encouraging to hear that in your voice.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.910
Where'd <i>that</i> come from?

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:49.790
A person's voice is amazing.

00:18:54.910 --> 00:19:02.290
I'm fairy-possessed, so I can hear fairy voices,
but I need to pay heed to human voices too.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.500
Hey, Marlya.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.450
Yes?

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:15.120
I'd say you've been listening closely
to our voices this whole time.

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:17.120
Maybe so.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:29.250
She might be...

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:33.160
Do what you think is best.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.950
Ver, are you there?

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.580
Marlya, why are you here?

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.660
Ver, listen.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:54.000
The Eins Order is after us
because we're fairy-possessed.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:58.580
They're trying to use a fairy-possessed
fairy organ to do something unthinkable!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.790
Okay. And?

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:06.000
Dorothea can keep you safe!
This time I'll protect <i>you</i> .

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.950
And my comrades will help!

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:11.700
You know what I'm trying to do.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:15.580
I know. But, now...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:19.620
I'm prepared. Now I simply await my chance.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.450
No one can stop me.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.330
Not even me?

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:28.370
If you want to stop me no
matter what, just kill me.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.040
There's no other way.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.950
I could never do that!

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:36.040
Probably not. But I'm different.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:40.250
Even if you were the one in my way, I would--

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.040
You wouldn't do such a thing!

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:51.700
I'm going now.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:53.160
Wait, Ver!

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:55.250
You can hear fairy voices too, can't you?!

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:59.540
I don't think your fairy desires revenge either!

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:01.450
Voices...

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:04.500
Those little ones are suffering.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:08.580
This isn't a comfortable world, for fairies.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:11.910
I'm sure we humans are to blame.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.410
Ver!

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:26.200
She was right there...

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:29.160
...but my voice didn't reach her.

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:03.870
I heard you were in prison.

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:05.910
How'd you break out?

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:09.200
W-Well, Wolfran Row pulled some strings.

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:12.500
So, you're his errand boy?

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:14.870
I wouldn't put it that way.

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:17.950
I'm just worth using, is all.

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:22.330
As you'd expect from a top-notch gofer,
Colonel, I have a job opportunity for you.

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:26.500
It's going to be the ultimate stage.
Once in a lifetime!

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:31.250
The only one in the world who can
pull off the lead role is you, Colonel!

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:35.540
Who's my opponent?

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:37.830
Who do I get to fight?

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:41.700
I'll finish you with my own two hands.

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:44.870
We only need one fairy-possessed.

